Note: this template is intended as a private base for internally developed WordPress themes.
Should a theme built on top of it ever be distributed publicly (e.g. via WordPress.org) or
incorporate GPL-licensed WordPress core code in a way that triggers GPL's copyleft, that specific
derivative project needs its own GPL-compatible license — this file only covers the base template
itself while it stays unpublished/internal (see docs/to-do.md, Abschnitt 1).
